  "worked_solution": "The segment $\\overset{―}{BC}$ joins two adjacent vertices. Thus, $\\overset{―}{BC}$ is a side of the polygon.\n\nThe segment $\\overset{―}{DF}$ joins two non-adjacent vertices. Therefore, $\\overset{―}{DF}$ is a diagonal.",
